mesa3d的库编译说明

安装依赖包
sudo apt-get install -y meson cmake llvm ninja-build pkg-config 
python3 -m pip install meson==0.62.0
pip install mako atomic markupsafe

打patch
cd ~/code/ohos/third_party/mesa3d
git apply ~/code/ohos/device/soc/ascend/310B/hardware/gpu/0001-display-mesa3d-init.patch

编译
python ohos/build_ohos64.py ~/code/ohos 310B ~/code/ohos/third_party/mesa3d

拷贝生成的库到ascend 310B对应目录
./copy.sh

